#: scenario8:scenario8_3415F546_2206_41FD_913E_036A55A19598
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7744707402985f12482d65b332841a613a12202370b875d315196714c1054134
#. default-sha256: e0e0f5a23070edae948fef5a65f8958b97d7d0838169e7c5a5a314560e540459
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3415F546_2206_41FD_913E_036A55A19598"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But all my questions, my confusion, my frustration—⟪k:1⟫everything that composes my "
"“present”—⟪k:2⟫is superseded by that darkness...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫...wisping away into nothing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas todas as minhas perguntas, minha confusão, minha frustração—⟪k:1⟫tudo o que compõe o meu "
"“presente”—⟪k:2⟫é substituído por essa escuridão...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫...desaparecendo no nada."

#: scenario8:scenario8_95E8F20B_9A0E_4DF1_AA86_833544152729
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ef535b037edd21ca2d7286f4a1c252f7f9ff577905213d839d439078c19db88
#. default-sha256: ec07f81875c98eb1ba74badcbfe5680b43e2a1b4c243ac4cd38f44d1559f1dc2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_95E8F20B_9A0E_4DF1_AA86_833544152729"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I never “yearned” for the world outside what I knew. ⟪k:1⟫I more “coveted” it—a splash of "
"spite mixed in. ⟪k:2⟫I wanted to claw my way up the mountain, knock all the bastards down who had "
"never seen what it was like at the bottom.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫If I made it high enough, I could do "
"anything. ⟪k:6⟫I would have complete freedom.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫If that sounds like a childish "
"fantasy to you, well, you’d be right. That’s exactly what it was."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nunca “ansiei” pelo mundo fora do que eu conhecia. ⟪k:1⟫Eu mais o “cobiçava”—com um toque de "
"rancor misturado. ⟪k:2⟫Queria cortar meu caminho até o topo da montanha, derrubando todos os "
"desgraçados que nunca tinham visto como era lá embaixo.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Se eu chegasse alto o "
"suficiente, poderia fazer qualquer coisa. ⟪k:6⟫Teria liberdade total.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Se isso "
"lhe parece uma fantasia infantil, bem, você está certo. Era exatamente o que era."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3A6D383F_D886_440A_97F6_7CC9B5C6389A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e016d2b12013626150f838a2a4fa8d5bb05cd142e1e1b7cfe5346ce39f8ebd51
#. default-sha256: f7c4514140e39d7c4952872af629fac7fcfb1712c54176938a18450c60b18d81
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3A6D383F_D886_440A_97F6_7CC9B5C6389A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“There you are. ⟪k:1⟫You spend so much time in the graveyard that,⟪k:2⟫one of these days, "
"someone’s going to think you’re a gravekeeper—⟪k:3⟫or maybe a graverobber.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“I can "
"understand a grave⟪k:7⟫keeper⟪k:8⟫, but I take offense at the suggestion I look like a grave⟪k:9⟫"
"robber⟪k:10⟫. ⟪k:11⟫I’m praying for the souls who have no one to see them off.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫The girl—named Morgana—turned around to face me. ⟪k:16⟫Though I’d known her for some time, "
"I’d rarely ever looked her in the eyes. ⟪k:17⟫Her face was almost always concealed beneath a dark "
"hood, revealing only the tip of her nose and sometimes her lips."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Aí está você. ⟪k:1⟫Você passa tanto tempo no cemitério que,⟪k:2⟫um dia desses, alguém vai "
"pensar que é uma coveira—⟪k:3⟫ou talvez uma ladra de túmulos.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“Consigo entender "
"⟪k:7⟫coveira⟪k:8⟫, mas me ofendo com a sugestão de que pareço uma ⟪k:9⟫ladra de túmulos⟪k:10⟫. "
"⟪k:11⟫Estou rezando pelas almas que não têm ninguém para vê-las partir.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫A "
"garota—chamada Morgana—virou-se para me encarar. ⟪k:16⟫Embora eu a conhecesse há algum tempo, "
"raramente a olhava nos olhos. ⟪k:17⟫Seu rosto estava quase sempre escondido sob um capuz escuro, "
"revelando apenas a ponta do nariz e às vezes os lábios."

#: scenario8:scenario8_67C1772B_FF27_45C8_8ED4_4E60EADBB8D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6db340dc661adc09c6a749948c3e3af114c1a6285678c20fc396bd25305a8ce9
#. default-sha256: 8c5cf11049c519d3c8c10930a45225dc2ef9a10cf1fe9c24315a0b74732bb5ea
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_67C1772B_FF27_45C8_8ED4_4E60EADBB8D8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Honestly, I don’t get it. Why do you care so much?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“These are souls that "
"have no one else to pray for them. ⟪k:4⟫At best,⟪k:5⟫they may get a bit of lip service from a "
"priest once or twice. ⟪k:6⟫It’s our responsibility to offer a helping hand to the sick and the "
"poor, ⟪k:7⟫to pray for the abandoned souls.”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫“What I don’t get is why you need to "
"pray for the dead at all. ⟪k:11⟫They’re just bags of bones.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“I hope you enjoy "
"an eternity in Hell, blasphemer.”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“Hey! ⟪k:18⟫That was uncalled for!”⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫"
"⟪k:21⟫“I’m just joking, obviously.”⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫“You take black humor to a new level!”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Sinceramente, não entendo. Por que você se importa tanto?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Estas são almas "
"que não têm mais ninguém para rezar por elas. ⟪k:4⟫Na melhor das hipóteses,⟪k:5⟫podem ter "
"recebido uma oração de um padre uma ou duas vezes. ⟪k:6⟫É nossa responsabilidade oferecer ajuda "
"aos doentes e aos pobres, ⟪k:7⟫rezar pelas almas abandonadas.”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫“O que eu não "
"entendo é por que você precisa rezar pelos mortos. ⟪k:11⟫Eles são apenas sacos de ossos.”⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“Espero que você aproveite a eternidade no Inferno, blasfemador.”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫"
"⟪k:17⟫“Ei! ⟪k:18⟫Isso foi desnecessário!”⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫“Estou só brincando, obviamente.”⟪k:22⟫"
"⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫“Você leva o humor negro para um outro nível!”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_2CC37D5E_F21F_4BAE_B73F_9B2D6284E332
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 398e2ad842df3feb90c1b695c11034a144d803f94d142a30413ee7e2b66526e6
#. default-sha256: fb79c9cf20c9ffd89ae5dfeeb671d94fe8fca365d780fcdd6681dc94862bc668
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2CC37D5E_F21F_4BAE_B73F_9B2D6284E332"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Morgana gave me a curt shrug, then turned away. ⟪k:1⟫She never faced anyone head-on for very "
"long, and she had a perfectly good reason for it. ⟪k:2⟫It wasn’t because she disliked me or "
"anything. ⟪k:3⟫...I don’t think, anyway.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫About three years earlier, something "
"had happened that had caused large patches of flesh to fall off her face. ⟪k:8⟫Supposedly, she "
"had looked fine before then, but I only knew her as she was at that time. ⟪k:9⟫The rest of her "
"body was covered in wounds as well, but applying ointment to them had reduced the scarring "
"significantly.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Her face, though, showed no signs of recovering."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Morgana deu de ombros para mim e então se virou. ⟪k:1⟫Ela nunca encarava ninguém de frente "
"por muito tempo, e tinha uma razão perfeitamente boa para isso. ⟪k:2⟫Não era porque não gostava "
"de mim ou algo assim. ⟪k:3⟫...Acho que não, pelo menos.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Cerca de três anos "
"antes, algo aconteceu que fez com que grandes pedaços de carne caíssem de seu rosto. ⟪k:8⟫"
"Supostamente, sua aparência era boa antes disso, mas eu só a conhecia como ela era nesta época. "
"⟪k:9⟫O resto do corpo dela também estava coberto de feridas, mas a aplicação de pomada reduziu "
"significativamente as cicatrizes.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Seu rosto, porém, não mostrava sinais de "
"recuperação."

#: scenario8:scenario8_AD23439B_53AA_4221_A353_48E40769E717
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df6b3739a2d29946b3b548a29c01144266bd8eb47412f8518f0f30d6e09593d0
#. default-sha256: 08e0720060a0c94e57a3ed563cad4245defeceb6b038c59a96190925e95c0e8d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_AD23439B_53AA_4221_A353_48E40769E717"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With a forlorn graveyard as their backdrop, a young man applied salve to a girl’s raw, "
"exposed flesh. ⟪k:1⟫It was quite possibly the least romantic sight in the world.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I "
"would have, at the very least, preferred a somewhat more pleasant location.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫As the "
"thought fluttered through my mind, I let out a defeated laugh, and I could soon feel her glaring "
"at me.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Morgana could be a bit standoffish, but honestly, I didn’t mind.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"For her, this was actually quite sociable, in fact. ⟪k:13⟫When I first met her,⟪k:14⟫she didn’t "
"act her age at all, but now, she was starting to show signs of the twelve-year-old girl hidden "
"inside."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Com um cemitério abandonado como pano de fundo, um jovem aplicou pomada na carne viva e "
"exposta de uma garota. ⟪k:1⟫Foi possivelmente a visão menos romântica do mundo.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu "
"teria, no mínimo, preferido um local um pouco mais agradável.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Enquanto o pensamento "
"flutuava em minha mente, soltei uma risada derrotada e logo pude senti-la me encarando.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫Morgana pode ser um pouco indiferente, mas honestamente, não me importo. ⟪k:11⟫Para ela, "
"isto era bastante sociável, na verdade. ⟪k:12⟫Quando a conheci, não agia de acordo com sua idade, "
"mas agora, estava começando a mostrar sinais da menina de doze anos escondida dentro dela."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F1A96C76_9177_4550_97E0_AE448E6B9E47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 193226719a385caac7b0af168cb55c469f433803620a7b53b4edf7fd2e52747e
#. default-sha256: f2d05f874225b13efa3ba702ebf526bbdb1922487746bacaefd85ebaf497128f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F1A96C76_9177_4550_97E0_AE448E6B9E47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Three years prior, when I met Morgana, she had been the victim of unspeakable abuse at the "
"hands of the lord. ⟪k:1⟫I didn’t know why he had done those things to her, ⟪k:2⟫and I didn’t ask "
"either—because I knew doing so would only reopen old wounds. ⟪k:3⟫All I knew was that the lord "
"was so far gone as a human being as to brutally torture a nine-year-old girl.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫At "
"the time, the only thing that ever seemed to come out of her mouth was the word of God. ⟪k:7⟫"
"Everything she said or did was ostensibly for the benefit of others, ⟪k:8⟫but it felt to me more "
"like she was acting out of some sort of sense of duty rather than genuine concern. ⟪k:9⟫"
"Honorable, but ultimately hollow.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫I much, much preferred this Morgana, "
"⟪k:14⟫even if she could be a bit... jaded."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Três anos atrás, quando conheci Morgana, ela havia sido vítima de abusos indizíveis nas mãos "
"do lorde. ⟪k:1⟫Eu não sabia por que ele tinha feito aquelas coisas com ela, ⟪k:2⟫e eu também não "
"perguntei—porque eu sabia que fazer isso só reabriria velhas feridas. ⟪k:3⟫Tudo o que eu sabia "
"era que o lorde era tão incorrigível como ser humano a ponto de torturar brutalmente uma menina "
"de nove anos.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Naquela época, a única coisa que parecia sair de sua boca era a "
"palavra de Deus. ⟪k:7⟫Tudo o que dizia ou fazia era ostensivamente para o benefício dos outros, "
"⟪k:8⟫mas para mim parecia mais que ela estava agindo por algum tipo de senso de dever do que por "
"preocupação genuína. ⟪k:9⟫Honorável, mas em última análise vazio.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Eu "
"preferia muito, muito mais essa Morgana, ⟪k:14⟫mesmo que ela pudesse ser um pouco... aborrecida."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EEC57AB7_24CC_4487_88E7_654011AAFDFD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2307f128758435ff60e579afa4f111f7661f8657da7856c258e8b1ed04b0924a
#. default-sha256: bd58bbe56ee8b801ba2d3b7893d4c36968b5d266214afd2a5bff0edd88df6243
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EEC57AB7_24CC_4487_88E7_654011AAFDFD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“What are you hoping to get out of repairing my face?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“I’m not trying to "
"‘get’ anything. I just want you to heal up.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“And here I thought you were going to "
"try and make me work at the brothel.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“How many times do I have to tell you? I’m "
"not going to make you be a prostitute.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“What other reason could you have for "
"wanting my face to get better?”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“Because I want to see it. ⟪k:16⟫Isn’t that "
"enough?”⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“............”⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫“Just so we’re clear, uh, that wasn’t "
"me hitting on you, okay?”⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫“The thought never occurred to me.”⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫"
"⟪k:28⟫“............”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“O que espera ganhar reparando meu rosto?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Não estou tentando \"ganhar\" "
"nada. Só quero que você se cure.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“E eu aqui pensando que ia tentar me fazer "
"trabalhar no bordel.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“Quantas vezes tenho que te dizer? Eu não vou te fazer virar "
"uma prostituta.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“Que outra razão você poderia ter para querer que meu rosto "
"melhorasse?”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“Porque eu quero ver ele. ⟪k:16⟫Não é o suficiente?”⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫"
"⟪k:19⟫“............”⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫“Só para deixar claro, uh, isso não fui eu dando em cima de "
"você, tá bem?”⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫“O pensamento nem passou pela minha cabeça.”⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫"
"⟪k:28⟫“............”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_476B2853_E41B_4320_98A8_488FE11C40C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33aa11013ac2f0a867945ef1cf54484c4f93f6756f2f338980282f14d853981c
#. default-sha256: 590f2a9ec1f840569f604b36090a95d9d1f868d7a604b26e3615c31dd87d3f41
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_476B2853_E41B_4320_98A8_488FE11C40C1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She fell quiet, sitting there motionless as I rubbed ointment into her face. ⟪k:1⟫Her skin "
"beneath my thumb was rough and unpleasant to the touch—and, honestly, rather stomach-turning. "
"⟪k:2⟫It was hard to imagine her face would ⟪k:3⟫ever⟪k:4⟫ heal.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫What I’d said "
"about wanting to see her face was true, ⟪k:9⟫but what I wanted more than anything was for her to "
"be able to live a relatively normal life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela ficou quieta, sentada ali imóvel enquanto eu esfregava pomada em seu rosto. ⟪k:1⟫A pele "
"dela sob meu polegar era áspera e desagradável ao toque—e, honestamente, de revirar o estômago. "
"⟪k:2⟫Era difícil imaginar que seu rosto ⟪k:3⟫algum dia⟪k:4⟫ iria sarar.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫O que "
"eu disse sobre querer ver o rosto dela era verdade, ⟪k:9⟫mas o que eu queria mais do que tudo era "
"que ela pudesse viver uma vida relativamente normal."

#: scenario8:scenario8_18791202_5BCB_4651_855B_39F3CAB6E65F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0d7499158550699be621aff442e412e90bcfaefb6afbd41e863fa24a1962bb0
#. default-sha256: 5e8c0e8430fc0ec6747246df6aed7b034a9cf9fd669305ef5e6b2d94ec0a7789
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_18791202_5BCB_4651_855B_39F3CAB6E65F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had no parents. ⟪k:1⟫When I’d asked about her mother, she’d gotten cagey with me, so I "
"assumed she’d been sold off. ⟪k:2⟫When I’d asked about her father, though, she’d just pointed up "
"at the sky, which I took to mean he was dead.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫A young girl, no family, sent off all "
"on her own to some strange land, somewhere along the line ending up in the lord’s cruel grasp. "
"⟪k:6⟫“Misfortune” felt like an understatement, if anything.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫That said, it "
"wasn’t just out of pity that I gave Morgana so much of my attention. ⟪k:11⟫The other reason, "
"though... well, she’d probably go running if I told her. ⟪k:12⟫Hell, ⟪k:13⟫I⟪k:14⟫ wanted to hit "
"myself over the head."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela não tinha pais. ⟪k:1⟫Quando perguntei sobre sua mãe, ela ficou cautelosa comigo, então "
"presumi que ela tinha sido vendida. ⟪k:2⟫Quando perguntei sobre seu pai, porém, ela apenas "
"apontou para o céu, o que interpretei como um sinal de que ele estava morto.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Uma "
"jovem, sem família, enviada sozinha para uma terra estranha, em algum lugar ao longo do caminho, "
"acabando nas garras cruéis do lorde. ⟪k:6⟫“Infortúnio” parecia um eufemismo, se não outra coisa."
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Dito isso, não foi só por pena que dei tanta atenção à Morgana. ⟪k:11⟫O "
"outro motivo, porém... bem, ela provavelmente sairia correndo se eu contasse. ⟪k:12⟫Droga, ⟪k:13⟫"
"eu⟪k:14⟫ queria me bater na cabeça."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2DAB02C2_9D17_4903_A9DD_F5DCD3E8E55C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7d1c55bf35200e0df08d2431b582b5631ea4017c01db803d93cefa15d63a8bc
#. default-sha256: aad919d433cfa761a464ed99ffeb56a307c800f90bcc50ad2fe2755299dcec4c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2DAB02C2_9D17_4903_A9DD_F5DCD3E8E55C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She gave a sheepish nod, which was honestly kind of cute, but of course I couldn’t ⟪k:1⟫"
"say⟪k:2⟫ that, ⟪k:3⟫so I shrugged my shoulders, feigning exasperation, and then turned to leave."
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Once, I might have offered to accompany her back to the brothel, but Morgana "
"never seemed keen on the idea of walking anywhere with me. ⟪k:8⟫Maybe she was afraid of grown "
"men, after what had happened to her at the lord’s manor, ⟪k:9⟫or maybe she just didn’t want me to "
"be seen with someone who looked like her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela deu um aceno tímido, o que honestamente foi meio fofo, mas é claro que eu não poderia "
"⟪k:1⟫dizer⟪k:2⟫ isso, ⟪k:3⟫então dei de ombros, fingindo exasperação, e me virei para sair.⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Antes, eu poderia ter me oferecido para acompanhá-la de volta ao bordel, mas "
"Morgana nunca pareceu interessada na ideia de caminhar comigo para qualquer lugar. ⟪k:8⟫Talvez "
"ela tivesse medo de homens adultos, depois do que aconteceu com ela na mansão do senhor, ⟪k:9⟫ou "
"talvez simplesmente não quisesse que eu fosse visto com alguém com a aparência dela."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3BFAABCD_3881_48BB_A209_2E658D3708D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9443542bb48b76140b9fc630faf60ac530d3e36a1c1bc4b8ae82b58b741feea1
#. default-sha256: 83a014e43880889bb9ef19876c968b18dc4e78a1786566aa9047a66efa988c8f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3BFAABCD_3881_48BB_A209_2E658D3708D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Three years back, there was a slave revolt at the lord’s manor. ⟪k:4⟫That’s "
"not ⟪k:5⟫quite⟪k:6⟫ accurate, though, ⟪k:7⟫because, while I was partly responsible for inciting "
"the riot, I wasn’t actually a slave.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The local lord was spoken of—in whispers"
"—as the second coming of the great tyrant of old. ⟪k:12⟫The people were constantly grumbling "
"about how he seemed to treat the land like his own personal playground, exploiting everything and "
"everyone on it for his own amusement.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫When enough stress and resentment "
"builds up in a contained space, all it takes is a little shove from the outside to burst. ⟪k:17⟫"
"And that was our plan—me and a number of other dissatisfied citizens gathered together to pop "
"that bubble and give the lord a taste of how we felt about him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Três anos atrás, houve uma revolta de escravos na mansão do lorde. ⟪k:4⟫Dizer "
"isso não é ⟪k:5⟫totalmente⟪k:6⟫ preciso, porém, ⟪k:7⟫porque, embora eu fosse parcialmente "
"responsável por incitar o motim, eu não era realmente um escravo.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫O lorde "
"local era mencionado—em sussurros—como a segunda vinda do grande tirano de antigamente. ⟪k:12⟫As "
"pessoas reclamavam constantemente sobre como ele parecia tratar a terra como seu playground "
"pessoal, explorando tudo e todos nela para sua própria diversão.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Quando "
"estresse e ressentimento suficientes se acumulam em um espaço contido, tudo o que é preciso é um "
"pequeno empurrão de fora para estourar. ⟪k:17⟫E esse era o nosso plano—eu e vários outros "
"cidadãos insatisfeitos nos reunimos para estourar essa bolha e dar ao lorde uma amostra de como "
"nos sentíamos em relação a ele."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8AA266C5_EB4C_4D26_823D_BBBACC2774C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 207ea83440916635474b8dfaba8124c2dc3d49ebcf8a303d21e1ba8a71080988
#. default-sha256: 99cd6744c2a3fe2296efb70a7c96d590f91aa3c7ff5fcc1ccf704e40e53c9832
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8AA266C5_EB4C_4D26_823D_BBBACC2774C4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Once I was inside, I went around the manor telling all the slaves about our plan. ⟪k:1⟫Most "
"of them had long since lost the will to fight, but with enough assurance there were people on the "
"outside ready and waiting to help, glimmers of hope started to return to their eyes. ⟪k:2⟫Finding "
"out they weren’t alone, that they weren’t helpless anymore, had an incredible effect on their "
"morale.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫And once the slaves were convinced, the revolt began.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫It "
"ended up being much larger in scale than I had imagined, and many lost their lives in the "
"process, but the majority of them managed to escape. ⟪k:10⟫Naturally, the slaves couldn’t stay in "
"the city, so I directed them to people waiting outside who would take them to another city or a "
"neighboring country."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Uma vez lá dentro, circulei pela mansão contando a todos os escravos sobre o nosso plano. "
"⟪k:1⟫A maioria deles já havia perdido a vontade de lutar há muito tempo, mas com a certeza de que "
"havia pessoas do lado de fora prontas e esperando para ajudar, vislumbres de esperança começaram "
"a retornar aos seus olhos. ⟪k:2⟫Descobrir que não estavam sozinhos, que não estavam mais "
"indefesos, teve um efeito incrível em seu moral.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫E uma vez que os escravos "
"foram convencidos, a revolta começou.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Acabou sendo muito maior em escala do que eu "
"imaginava, e muitos perderam suas vidas no processo, mas a maioria deles conseguiu escapar. ⟪k:10⟫"
"Naturalmente, os escravos não podiam ficar na cidade, então eu os encaminhei para pessoas "
"esperando do lado de fora que os levariam para outra cidade ou um país vizinho."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B557D967_F5AF_4020_9B24_EF91766A6768
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a4a11e35c7af7367a7d1a74591b0a4bcdfb741332e71df458d1e056a7d9f5d4
#. default-sha256: 9f0efaf4e4af7b307952e1d90699954256454e62ddbb3738b290e6b360cbb06d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B557D967_F5AF_4020_9B24_EF91766A6768"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Skip forward to about a month before Morgana’s birthday.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫One day, a middle-"
"aged woman approached me. ⟪k:4⟫I had never met her before, but she had wavy hair that reminded me "
"a great deal of my own.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Looking me straight in the eye, the woman said:⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“I was once a maidservant for the Barnier estate. ⟪k:12⟫They’ve done their best to "
"keep it secret, but I had a child with the previous lord. ⟪k:13⟫And that child... is you.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avançando cerca de um mês antes do aniversário de Morgana.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Um dia, uma mulher "
"de meia-idade se aproximou de mim. ⟪k:4⟫Eu nunca tinha visto ela antes, mas tinha cabelos "
"ondulados que me lembravam muito os meus.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Olhando-me diretamente nos olhos, a "
"mulher disse:⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Eu já fui criada da propriedade Barnier. ⟪k:12⟫Eles fizeram o "
"possível para manter isso em segredo, mas eu tive um filho com o lorde anterior. ⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫E "
"essa criança... é você.”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_EEFEEA2A_55E0_44CF_AB21_DD357EEEB931
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31ca22875d463bf78864db4a883096e72c8e3986fe166fd9fb1aeea1e4f30df1
#. default-sha256: 08455811ec7dcbf29ed8b767159019012be187e892b2f85b2bd193f00dd5ebc9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EEFEEA2A_55E0_44CF_AB21_DD357EEEB931"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I obviously wasn’t going to agree on the spot. ⟪k:1⟫Her story was so blatantly dubious I "
"needed some time to think on it. ⟪k:2⟫If she ⟪k:3⟫was⟪k:4⟫ telling the truth, though, it could "
"transform our revolution from a dream into a reality. ⟪k:5⟫We wouldn’t be restricted to inciting "
"inconsequential uprisings. I could seize power legitimately and make some actual change.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫So I asked the woman to give me some time to consider."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Obviamente, eu não concordaria na hora. ⟪k:1⟫A história dela era tão descaradamente duvidosa "
"que precisei de um tempo para refletir. ⟪k:2⟫Se ela ⟪k:3⟫estivesse⟪k:4⟫ dizendo a verdade, porém, "
"isso poderia transformar nossa revolução de um sonho em realidade. ⟪k:5⟫Não estaríamos limitados "
"a incitar revoltas inconsequentes. Eu poderia tomar o poder legitimamente e fazer alguma mudança "
"real.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Então pedi à mulher que me desse algum tempo para pensar."

#: scenario8:scenario8_332173AC_1F2D_4894_ADCF_342EA0D332B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a45c436b0996187cb0721d27903869e36e29ee200e51bb4e21e1905137a0da43
#. default-sha256: 0d075f7129f9770aa30e8156e8ef6030a89becf760bd9094682b05a5096b1674
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_332173AC_1F2D_4894_ADCF_342EA0D332B0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“So, is today the day? ⟪k:1⟫Are you finally gonna tell her how you feel?”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫“⟪k:5⟫Excuse me?⟪k:6⟫ ⟪k:7⟫Tell her how I ⟪k:8⟫what⟪k:9⟫?!”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“Don’t be coy. "
"⟪k:13⟫You know exactly what, and it’s about time you manned up and told her. ⟪k:14⟫I think you’ve "
"got a better chance than you think.”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“Do I need to remind you how old she "
"is?”⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫“Twelve, as of today. ⟪k:21⟫Practically an adult. ⟪k:22⟫I was knee-deep in "
"dick at that age.”⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫“You’re comparing her to ⟪k:26⟫you⟪k:27⟫?”⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫"
"⟪k:30⟫“The longer you hold off saying something, the more difficult it becomes.”⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫"
"⟪k:33⟫“............”⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫“Break a leg! ⟪k:37⟫Party’s gonna be in the back, so there "
"won’t be any customers around to interfere.”⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫⟪k:40⟫“...A-All right.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Então, hoje é o dia? ⟪k:1⟫Você finalmente vai dizer a ela como se sente?”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫“⟪k:5⟫Com licença?⟪k:6⟫ ⟪k:7⟫Dizer a ela como eu ⟪k:8⟫o que⟪k:9⟫?!”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“Não "
"seja tímido. ⟪k:13⟫Sabe exatamente o que, e já era hora de se recompor e contar a ela. ⟪k:14⟫Acho "
"que você tem mais chance do que pensa.”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“Preciso te lembrar quantos anos ela "
"tem?”⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫“Doze, a partir de hoje. ⟪k:21⟫Praticamente uma adulta. ⟪k:22⟫Eu estava "
"atolada em rola nessa idade.”⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫“Está comparando ela a ⟪k:26⟫você⟪k:27⟫?”⟪k:28⟫"
"⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫“Quanto mais adiar dizer algo, mais difícil se tornará.”⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫"
"⟪k:33⟫“............”⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫“Faça um esforço! ⟪k:37⟫A festa vai ser nos fundos, então "
"não haverá clientes por perto para atrapalhar.”⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫⟪k:40⟫“...T-Tudo bem.”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F2BE155B_F61C_442A_80A4_3AF832BBD871
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0967c393f271d348ee3abfbacf3e9b256edb1dbc4cb828c6576358c1d3d98afd
#. default-sha256: 08c909c62521eba12aa3e02f62d977691a89c80af3ff0a5e47b692b4f6b015a7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F2BE155B_F61C_442A_80A4_3AF832BBD871"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Women seem to have this strange, somewhat terrifying ability to read people’s minds, ⟪k:1⟫"
"and Maria was a prime example of that. ⟪k:2⟫I had never once so much as suggested to anyone I "
"might think anything of Morgana, but Maria had somehow managed to pick up on it almost "
"immediately.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Fortunately, she didn’t seem particularly bothered by the fact, ⟪k:6⟫"
"though if anyone else were to find out, I could only imagine the looks I would get.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"I mean, Morgana was twelve, and I was twenty-two. ⟪k:10⟫That wasn’t normal.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫(I’ve never felt this way about anyone else that young, either...)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ As mulheres parecem ter essa estranha e um tanto assustadora habilidade de ler a mente das "
"pessoas, ⟪k:1⟫e Maria era um exemplo perfeito disso. ⟪k:2⟫Eu nunca havia sequer sugerido a alguém "
"que eu poderia pensar algo sobre Morgana, mas Maria de alguma forma conseguiu perceber isso quase "
"imediatamente.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Felizmente, ela não pareceu particularmente incomodada com o fato, "
"⟪k:6⟫embora se alguém mais descobrisse, eu só poderia imaginar os olhares que receberia.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫Quer dizer, Morgana tinha doze anos e eu tinha vinte e dois. ⟪k:10⟫Isso não era normal.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫(Nunca me senti assim por ninguém tão jovem, também...)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_500F5DDB_332E_46A2_A289_636952A78399
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f7dbdf9df0420c4c3ba887433945d650d1cd296f08ebde130b941bad904feec
#. default-sha256: d07d38fc573c115c856e98ca63819b67e4642c5362868e92fb996dccf6c1412f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_500F5DDB_332E_46A2_A289_636952A78399"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(How would I even go about saying it, assuming I actually did?)⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫(“Even if "
"your face still isn’t healed in four years, I’ll take you as my lifetime partner, Morgana”?)⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫(God, no, that’s terrible. There has to be a better way to put it.)⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Now I was getting stressed out, and it was all thanks to Maria. ⟪k:13⟫This was "
"supposed to be a day of celebration, not of fretting over stupid personal matters."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Como eu poderia dizer isso, supondo que eu realmente dissesse?)⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫(“Mesmo "
"que seu rosto ainda não esteja curado em quatro anos, eu te aceitarei como minha parceira para "
"toda a vida, Morgana”?)⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫(Deus, não, isso é terrível. Tem que haver uma maneira "
"melhor de dizer isso.)⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Agora eu estava ficando estressado, e era tudo "
"graças à Maria. ⟪k:13⟫Este deveria ser um dia de comemoração, não de preocupação com questões "
"pessoais estúpidas."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F7183AEE_B86F_410D_9419_6E400CC154FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19f0ba3660f526b9559b11f45588e4c932af84e4afcc15b5038e2008c9ada708
#. default-sha256: d6b9ec586ec3b6bdceccf4cc7b346c6a71236b027047c7090ed7dd0ad67f47c8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F7183AEE_B86F_410D_9419_6E400CC154FA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Not long after I arrived at the brothel and made my way to the back room, Maria "
"and a handful of other unoccupied girls showed up. ⟪k:3⟫Morgana, who was supposed to be the guest "
"of honor, was even more reticent than usual.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫The prostitutes chatted amongst "
"themselves about work in unabashedly graphic detail, trading info on which customers were good "
"and which customers were bad, ⟪k:7⟫all the while Morgana looking incredibly uncomfortable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Pouco depois de chegar ao bordel e ir para a sala dos fundos, Maria e um punhado "
"de outras garotas desocupadas apareceram. ⟪k:3⟫Morgana, que deveria ser a convidada de honra, "
"estava ainda mais reticente do que o normal.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫As prostitutas conversavam entre si "
"sobre trabalho com descarados detalhes gráficos, trocando informações sobre quais clientes eram "
"bons e quais eram ruins, ⟪k:7⟫enquanto Morgana parecia incrivelmente desconfortável."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3F90CA22_CCC2_41AA_A4D9_3BF2BE519ECB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17100c1e16f69fce80e99cd1ea6a0645eb905812c8cd317c09973186a435f492
#. default-sha256: d9651cbb41f6178b0eca8faa7eb38845fe44dce5d10692cab47f0ef5643b7af5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3F90CA22_CCC2_41AA_A4D9_3BF2BE519ECB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“At least eat something, then. ⟪k:1⟫The cookies are barely sweetened and dry as rocks, but "
"they’re edible.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Jacopo, you little bitch! ⟪k:5⟫You’ve got some stones to shit-"
"talk my cookies to my face!”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“Stop it, Maria! ⟪k:9⟫Stop throwing things at "
"me!”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫The other girls cackled as Maria and I bickered. ⟪k:14⟫Hoping it "
"might have elicited a reaction from Morgana as well, I snuck a glance over at her, but she "
"remained expressionless."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Pelo menos coma alguma coisa, então. ⟪k:1⟫Os biscoitos estão insossos e secos como pedras, "
"mas são comestíveis.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Jacopo, sua vadiazinha! ⟪k:5⟫Você tem a coragem de falar "
"merda dos meus biscoitos na minha cara!”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“Pare com isso, Maria! ⟪k:9⟫Pare de jogar "
"coisas em mim!”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫As outras meninas riram enquanto Maria e eu brigávamos. "
"⟪k:14⟫Esperando que isso pudesse ter provocado uma reação de Morgana também, dei uma espiada, mas "
"ela permaneceu inexpressiva."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7B15FAFF_14CD_4DDC_A7B6_C0A345D38425
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 742c494a1874b128308dc4a4dff95346fde83628fb25a87a49d43c71c6d4b50b
#. default-sha256: fcaa90115b41c30cab2a5a9d6f71f25fd8527981e18c81244b0351649985aec2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7B15FAFF_14CD_4DDC_A7B6_C0A345D38425"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“You ⟪k:1⟫are⟪k:2⟫ right about one thing, though. This is Morgana’s day. ⟪k:3⟫So let’s "
"change the subject!” ⟪k:4⟫Maria said with a little laugh, having hurled everything within arm’s "
"reach at me.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“Like I said, I don’t have anything to talk about...”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫“Sure ya do. You just have to look a little harder. ⟪k:11⟫Not saying you have to reminisce "
"for us—it can be anything.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“............”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“Hmm, let’s see... "
"Here’s an idea: are there any guys you got your eyes on?”⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫I spewed my tea "
"all over the table.⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫“...There is.”⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫And then I "
"started choking."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Você ⟪k:1⟫está⟪k:2⟫ certo sobre uma coisa, no entanto. Hoje é o dia da Morgana. ⟪k:3⟫Então, "
"vamos mudar de assunto!”, ⟪k:4⟫disse Maria com uma risadinha, tendo jogado tudo o que estava ao "
"seu alcance em mim.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“Como eu disse, não tenho nada sobre o que falar...”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫“Claro que tem. Só precisa se esforçar um pouco mais. ⟪k:11⟫Não estou dizendo que você "
"precisa nos contar algo—pode ser qualquer coisa.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“............”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫"
"⟪k:17⟫“Hmm, vamos ver... Aqui vai uma ideia: tem algum cara que você está de olho?”⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Eu cuspi meu chá na mesa toda.⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫“...Tem.”⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫"
"⟪k:29⟫E então comecei a engasgar."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8B8CE834_8EB4_429D_AB7B_ECE664196D53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f9dbc46778af20e50bf49675a5c629d44c9fa10956bb7570814a4adcb01d2a5
#. default-sha256: 483326e8ed462eac9a5b41d3972f3347f1e990cf808dd330208711cd28e4b35b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8B8CE834_8EB4_429D_AB7B_ECE664196D53"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“What?! ⟪k:1⟫Seriously?! ⟪k:2⟫Holy shit! ⟪k:3⟫Who is it? Tell me, who’s the lucky guy?!”⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“God.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“............”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Everyone fell silent.⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Maria gave me a sympathetic look, and I knew exactly what she wanted to say. "
"⟪k:17⟫“Sorry kid, you ain’t got nothin’ on God.” ⟪k:18⟫Asshole."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“O que?! ⟪k:1⟫Sério?! ⟪k:2⟫Puta merda! ⟪k:3⟫Quem é? Me diga, quem é o sortudo?!”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫“Deus.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“............”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Todos ficaram em silêncio.⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Maria me lançou um olhar simpático, e eu sabia exatamente o que ela queria dizer. "
"⟪k:17⟫“Desculpe, garoto, você não tem nada a ver com Deus.” ⟪k:18⟫Babaca."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4FA94294_D47D_4EA3_AC3F_BA217C73E67A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5281ac9895bae2420a4aa65a94c96c7ecb9de1eb35371a1a32f77d7b9f215a40
#. default-sha256: fe61cbeed5415cc3153dbf9ebee0c68d80ffb9e98210c20f0520556ddd6d0193
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4FA94294_D47D_4EA3_AC3F_BA217C73E67A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“If you’re gonna dream, dream big, right? ⟪k:1⟫Yeah, I get where you’re coming from, pining "
"after the all-powerful, all-knowing God. I’m with you!”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“You bald-faced liar!”⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“The grass may be a helluva lot greener up there, but it’s a bit... far, don’t you "
"think? ⟪k:8⟫You’re better off settling for the weeds down here.”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫(Did she "
"just imply I’m a ⟪k:13⟫weed⟪k:14⟫?)⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Maria looked over and gave a wide grin "
"at the sight of me grinding my teeth, then continued,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Se vai sonhar, sonhe grande, certo? ⟪k:1⟫Sim, eu entendo você, ansiando pelo Deus todo-"
"poderoso e onisciente. Estou com você!”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Sua mentirosa descarada!”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“A "
"grama pode ser muito mais verde lá em cima, mas é um pouco... longe, não acha? ⟪k:8⟫É melhor se "
"contentar com as ervas daninhas aqui embaixo.”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫(Ela acabou de insinuar que "
"eu sou uma ⟪k:13⟫erva daninha⟪k:14⟫?)⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Maria deu um largo sorriso ao me ver "
"rangendo os dentes, então continuou,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DB8C24E3_6477_4944_BA29_7A46D1968B97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ed6d4bb598c9b0223eee4e35133ef124f9c3af69b62500fb80de3d529ac6f5d
