msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DB8C24E3_6477_4944_BA29_7A46D1968B97"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫This⟪k:6⟫, though...⟪k:7⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Isto⟪k:6⟫, no entanto...⟪k:7⟫"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F0EE88AB_81F4_4DA4_9D8A_0D472455FA40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf83ac575af701cf81acb2db94c469bd41f72444fc8aca02a38bea3573d0da30
#. default-sha256: cde4d9eb80b1cb74d8e147e7d25d0d12260541460ec96c7f51962179f9dd0fd6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F0EE88AB_81F4_4DA4_9D8A_0D472455FA40"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫no, this wasn’t the kind of story I was hoping for."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫não, isto não era o tipo de história que eu esperava."

#: scenario8:scenario8_508CD0CD_911F_4663_BBA3_F84E8FFD88CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be5520ebfd7da4984eae8cfbd6b497168ac400b90cd840d0f9d71453deb8a1ad
#. default-sha256: 6180d3a7ca9eaeab40ca1cd4651a3f26571ec72e4f5c1b8ab9c464e1de7fb8bd
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_508CD0CD_911F_4663_BBA3_F84E8FFD88CF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Shortly after Morgana stepped out, I heard a woman’s scream from the front of the "
"brothel. ⟪k:3⟫Next, a man shouting. ⟪k:4⟫At first, I assumed it was one of the customers losing "
"his temper over something, ⟪k:5⟫but the tone of the scream seemed somehow off for something like "
"that. ⟪k:6⟫It wasn’t long before the noise had escalated to alarming levels, so I dashed toward "
"the source of the shouting."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Logo depois que Morgana saiu, ouvi o grito de uma mulher na frente do bordel. ⟪k:3⟫"
"Em seguida, um homem gritando. ⟪k:4⟫A princípio, presumi que fosse um dos clientes perdendo a "
"paciência por alguma coisa, ⟪k:5⟫mas o tom do grito parecia de alguma forma incomum para algo "
"assim. ⟪k:6⟫Não demorou muito para que o barulho aumentasse a níveis alarmantes, então corri em "
"direção à fonte dos gritos."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3AAE2429_D120_4398_813E_B00FDA956689
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7c2bb2a0e8b8e1cf666c3ffc88f4efe7e8c1f973e28b86fd9a3800f9e59f7d5
#. default-sha256: 224513dab11aa4c628faf6e8632c0d52462c6820f9d825ef2df29af4f5b9a6d4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3AAE2429_D120_4398_813E_B00FDA956689"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A good dozen men, bandits—or maybe thieves, they seemed more organized—had raided the "
"brothel. ⟪k:1⟫They slaughtered all the customers, stripping them of any valuables, ⟪k:2⟫and they "
"tied up the girls, killing any who resisted.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The first thought that rose to my "
"panicked mind was that I needed to find Morgana. ⟪k:6⟫I needed to get her out of here, no matter "
"what. ⟪k:7⟫I couldn’t let her birthday turn into a tragedy.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫She had already been "
"through enough, and I had to make sure she didn’t suffer any further.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫I had to "
"make her life into something ⟪k:14⟫good⟪k:15⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Uma boa dúzia de homens, ladrões—ou talvez assaltantes, eles pareciam mais organizados—tinha "
"invadido o bordel. ⟪k:1⟫Massacraram todos os clientes, despojando-os de todos os seus bens "
"valiosos, ⟪k:2⟫e amarraram as garotas, matando qualquer um que resistisse.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫O "
"primeiro pensamento que surgiu na minha mente em pânico foi que eu precisava encontrar Morgana. "
"⟪k:6⟫Eu precisava tirá-la daqui, não importava o que acontecesse. ⟪k:7⟫Eu não podia deixar o "
"aniversário dela se transformar em uma tragédia.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Ela já tinha passado por muita "
"coisa e eu tinha que garantir que não sofresse mais nada.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Eu tinha que fazer da "
"vida dela algo ⟪k:14⟫bom⟪k:15⟫."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0381B2A2_3C2A_4C29_BB9F_FDCFFE7A3CDD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2bc400f7bf3a692575459ea8a31d299b39b8840261aebb3c030fe5ad1a90d07
#. default-sha256: 1973d5f4c3c721521caac375a305b90d2755a1bfc669cf060d4d7028172f94ef
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0381B2A2_3C2A_4C29_BB9F_FDCFFE7A3CDD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I searched and I searched, but there was no sign of Morgana anywhere, ⟪k:1⟫until suddenly, "
"something seemed to crash into me from behind, causing me to stagger.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It took a few "
"seconds for the pain to set in, which is when I looked down to see the tip of a blade sticking "
"out of my gut. ⟪k:5⟫Blood streamed along the metal surface, and there were little bits of flesh "
"caught on the edges.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I turned around just in time to see the man holding it kick me "
"away, ⟪k:9⟫and before I had time to process what was happening, I hit the floor and lost "
"consciousness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Procurei e procurei, mas não havia sinal de Morgana em lugar nenhum, ⟪k:1⟫até que de "
"repente, algo pareceu colidir em mim por trás, fazendo-me cambalear.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Demorou alguns "
"segundos para a dor se instalar, e foi então que olhei para baixo e vi a ponta de uma lâmina "
"saindo do meu estômago. ⟪k:5⟫Sangue escorria pela superfície metálica e havia pequenos pedaços de "
"carne presos nas bordas.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Virei-me bem a tempo de ver o homem que a segurava me "
"chutar para longe, ⟪k:9⟫e antes que eu tivesse tempo de processar o que estava acontecendo, bati "
"no chão e perdi a consciência."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F0FA741E_FB5E_46F6_8FE3_145A1E6157EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8c31bca1295e3afa9556f3694189a02a6ce673c92b962efcbeb55ec85c582b0
#. default-sha256: 8947409de2543bf14b620de657b5783a19b916ede8a216eaecc9af98533a423d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F0FA741E_FB5E_46F6_8FE3_145A1E6157EC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I were a hero, I could have surely eradicated all the violent intruders in the blink of "
"an eye, saving everyone.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Protected that which I wanted to protect.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"Not had to lose anything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se eu fosse um herói, certamente poderia ter erradicado todos os intrusos violentos num "
"piscar de olhos, salvando a todos.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Proteger o que eu queria proteger.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"Não ter que perder nada."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D3F788F6_EE3D_4C74_9148_9A2379F4C0EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c1ecd2e44acb9cfc1804236d7d262d872b62bbf11a597d0beafaabac286064b
#. default-sha256: aacb2de384a77d032864812ab8b02b18c481eb7626b7aa758445717548f81310
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D3F788F6_EE3D_4C74_9148_9A2379F4C0EC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When I woke up, Maria was kneeling over me, sobbing—no sign of the tough, foul-mouthed girl "
"I knew. ⟪k:1⟫Aside from her, there were two other girls, also crying, leaving only four survivors."
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Apparently I wasn’t dead.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Looking down, I saw my bare stomach "
"wrapped in bloodsoaked bandages."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quando acordei, Maria estava ajoelhada sobre mim, soluçando—nenhum sinal da garota durona e "
"boca suja que eu conhecia. ⟪k:1⟫Além dela, havia outras duas meninas, também chorando, deixando "
"apenas quatro sobreviventes.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Aparentemente eu não estava morto.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"Olhando para baixo, vi meu estômago nu envolto em bandagens encharcadas de sangue."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E6F46659_05F6_47DF_91F1_341440939AD3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0618038fbe3663f5f70088f97a47e27d211cce23fe28bebddf8caac8d9321bc0
#. default-sha256: a7d5c0287e7825c1f6caec5235014bf67fbe43e72d4ad434a4f5b87b59516e3a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E6F46659_05F6_47DF_91F1_341440939AD3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If only I had power.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Absolute, unflinching power.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫If I had "
"climbed to the top of the ladder when the chance was offered to me, ⟪k:7⟫this all could have been "
"avoided.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫If only I had asserted my place as royalty a month earlier, as the woman "
"who claimed to be my mother had urged me to..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se eu ao menos tivesse poder.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Poder absoluto e inabalável.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Se eu "
"tivesse subido ao topo da escada quando a oportunidade me foi oferecida, ⟪k:7⟫tudo isso poderia "
"ter sido evitado.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Se ao menos eu tivesse afirmado meu lugar como realeza um mês "
"antes, como a mulher que alegou ser minha mãe me incentivou a fazer..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B0629A92_6065_4B6F_A13E_9D528C19091B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7df141777bfc6f9e97777c29bc7d522b52c9ec5e3bd4c744391180f035c052f8
#. default-sha256: 0995b07def37074afbf2edb34a01849753fcaeafb2f21d8b55431936b2801d03
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B0629A92_6065_4B6F_A13E_9D528C19091B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wanted power.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The power to keep everything I cared about safe.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"The power to change this damned world.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫The power to stop those filthy thieves.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫The power... ⟪k:13⟫to keep her by my side.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫I wanted power."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu queria poder.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫O poder de manter tudo o que me importa seguro.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"O poder de mudar este maldito mundo.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫O poder de parar aqueles ladrões imundos.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫O poder... ⟪k:13⟫para mantê-la ao meu lado.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Eu queria poder."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CAAFB897_BB63_43A6_BB85_A39094DF7695
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3dae8cd533af31ffbdd2a8e04ec583dbcb72a5a298b221a49754a898a16011a8
#. default-sha256: acb2ce9f1dd31a9a0127d3a8f654a9062f7925c0d58933375bb8f832d6f73959
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CAAFB897_BB63_43A6_BB85_A39094DF7695"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“I heard about the attack on the brothel, ⟪k:3⟫and that you were hurt.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"I’m so glad to see you’re well.”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫About a week after the raid, I went to see "
"the woman who professed herself my mother. ⟪k:10⟫As you would expect of someone who had served at "
"the old lord’s manor, she was very elegant and graceful. ⟪k:11⟫The shack where she stayed, "
"though, was a shabby, drab place with bare wattle and daub walls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Soube do ataque ao bordel, ⟪k:3⟫e que você foi ferido.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Estou tão feliz "
"em ver que está bem.”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Cerca de uma semana após o ataque, fui ver a mulher que "
"se declarava minha mãe. ⟪k:10⟫Como seria de esperar de alguém que serviu na mansão do antigo "
"lorde, ela era muito elegante e graciosa. ⟪k:11⟫O barraco onde ficava, no entanto, era um lugar "
"surrado e enfadonho, com paredes de pau a pique."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BBC036A7_FB43_4F69_B6C9_BD7545E7CE28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ea1474d49c698bfa6ccd3d04e5b6faa545b02b7ffea823b3139313dc5b596f8
#. default-sha256: 31bf47f509d887b27ed2f812ead342fd490c63921028a600d82f5de731a29011
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BBC036A7_FB43_4F69_B6C9_BD7545E7CE28"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“You were concerned about my safety?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Of course. Show me a mother who is ⟪k:4⟫"
"not⟪k:5⟫ always concerned about her child’s safety.”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“Says the woman I’d never seen "
"until a month ago.”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Physical distance has no bearing on a mother’s love,” ⟪k:12⟫"
"she said with a soft smile.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Age had clearly begun taking its toll on her, "
"but I could see hints of former beauty."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Você estava preocupado com minha segurança?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“É claro. Existe uma mãe que "
"⟪k:4⟫não⟪k:5⟫ esteja sempre preocupada com a segurança de seu filho?”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“Diz a mulher "
"que eu nunca tinha visto até um mês atrás.”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“A distância física não tem "
"influência no amor de uma mãe”, ⟪k:12⟫disse ela com um sorriso suave.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫A "
"idade claramente começou a cobrar seu preço, mas eu podia ver indícios de uma beleza anterior."

#: scenario8:scenario8_25A29562_4ECF_4556_85FD_C2DA74BBAD6D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de7e694998f88114ecfe42992a7dce5e4fbcb15a48135bc4c9d61ea8bf6b8f75
#. default-sha256: b8c18c826e1362bde07af47e7fa24c0d7c38d73d50af572978af7d07b69dcd48
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_25A29562_4ECF_4556_85FD_C2DA74BBAD6D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Look at this. It’s the Barnier family crest. ⟪k:1⟫The previous lord gave me the ring as a "
"gift, ⟪k:2⟫and I’ve kept it ever since, even after our relationship was discovered and I was "
"chased out. ⟪k:3⟫I didn’t sell it... because I knew I was with child.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫“............”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“They will have no choice but to acknowledge you as a "
"legitimate heir if you show them this ring.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“Why did you wait so long to come "
"find me, then?”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“I was afraid they might kill you if I brought you in as a "
"baby.”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫“Why were we separated?”⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫“Misfortune. ⟪k:22⟫One day, "
"bandits came and kidnapped you. ⟪k:23⟫Presumably they were hired by the Barnier estate because "
"they didn’t want your existence coming to light.”⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫“............”⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫"
"⟪k:29⟫“I consider it a miracle you’re still alive.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Veja isto. É o brasão da família Barnier. ⟪k:1⟫O antigo lorde me deu o anel de presente, "
"⟪k:2⟫e o guardei desde então, mesmo depois que nosso relacionamento foi descoberto e fui expulsa. "
"⟪k:3⟫Eu não o vendi... porque sabia que estava grávida.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“............”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫“Eles não terão escolha a não ser reconhecê-lo como um herdeiro legítimo se você lhes "
"mostrar este anel.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“Por que esperou tanto para vir me encontrar, então?”⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“Eu estava com medo que eles pudessem te matar se eu te trouxesse quando bebê.”⟪k:16⟫"
"⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫“Por que fomos separados?”⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫“Infortúnio. ⟪k:22⟫Um dia, bandidos "
"vieram e sequestraram você. ⟪k:23⟫Presumivelmente, eles foram contratados pelos Barnier porque "
"não queriam que sua existência viesse à tona.”⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫“............”⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫"
"⟪k:29⟫“Eu considero um milagre que você ainda esteja vivo.”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_50A525F8_A595_46AA_9B98_A717CD92E89F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a991dc4b8a7236f010da8aa381b63cc7318912089f49951d11570aedf01834ce
#. default-sha256: 871c1f588347458b610824c600a942bada8e16afc3783f965b6e1110a803e226
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_50A525F8_A595_46AA_9B98_A717CD92E89F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I can only imagine the stern look on my face as I listened to the woman speak. ⟪k:1⟫Part of "
"me did, indeed, want to take everything she said as true. ⟪k:2⟫Wanted to believe I was someone "
"important.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫But I couldn’t convince myself I had anything other than a commoner’s "
"blood running through my veins."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Só consigo imaginar a expressão severa no meu rosto enquanto ouvia a mulher falar. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Parte de mim, de fato, queria aceitar tudo o que ela dizia como verdade. ⟪k:2⟫Queria acreditar "
"que eu era alguém importante.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Mas eu não conseguia me convencer de que tinha algo "
"além de sangue de plebeu correndo em minhas veias."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5486437C_79A4_4485_940A_B67428793838
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a805eb0ad71ffbd906c832aa08e21f98d952c65f16d608c3473f0d053eeae0d
#. default-sha256: 24b8ae1b172a136e1fec19914eeba9ef5f1be6d0773fce946a50d91be66a8d6c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5486437C_79A4_4485_940A_B67428793838"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“It would appear you’ve done your research. ⟪k:1⟫I don’t have any other family, to the best "
"of my knowledge, ⟪k:2⟫which does indeed make me a good candidate for you to step in and claim "
"your stake on. ⟪k:3⟫If I were to guess, your child with the lord has either passed away or never "
"existed at all.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“............”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“It’s probably true that you worked "
"at the Barniers’ manor, and it’s probably true that you had relations with the former lord. ⟪k:10⟫"
"You were chased out, and now you live in poverty. ⟪k:11⟫You want to go back to your former, more "
"comfortable life, and while you’re at it, take vengeance on the current lord.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫“............”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Parece que fez sua pesquisa. ⟪k:1⟫Não tenho nenhuma outra família, pelo que sei, ⟪k:2⟫o que "
"de fato me torna um bom candidato para você. ⟪k:3⟫Se eu tivesse que adivinhar, seu filho com o "
"lorde faleceu ou nunca existiu.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“............”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“Provavelmente é "
"verdade que trabalhou na mansão dos Barniers, e provavelmente é verdade que teve relações com o "
"antigo lorde. ⟪k:10⟫Foi expulsa e agora vive na pobreza. ⟪k:11⟫Você quer voltar para sua vida "
"anterior, mais confortável, e aproveitar para vingar-se do atual lorde.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫“............”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_143923A5_4479_43FC_8DDD_1F0A1CB88BF4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33b4f76260071b1784a96f2bf377c1c5073c0b0501fd6854fc9de2f48a774869
#. default-sha256: 9846767405d6243d90bc5b04dc6793c21bf8c5dffe40cafef95b9b2d3aea81cb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_143923A5_4479_43FC_8DDD_1F0A1CB88BF4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Haven’t you had enough danger for one life? ⟪k:1⟫C’mon, forget about all this revolution "
"stuff. ⟪k:2⟫We can build up a new brothel and just stay low for the rest of our days. Does that "
"really sound so bad? ⟪k:3⟫You’re the only friend I’ve got left, Jacopo,” ⟪k:4⟫she said, somewhat "
"desperately.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I sympathized with her concerns, but I didn’t want to let this chance to "
"gain some real power slip away.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I was done having things taken away from me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Já não teve perigo suficiente por uma vida? ⟪k:1⟫Vamos lá, esqueça toda essa coisa de "
"revolução. ⟪k:2⟫Podemos construir um novo bordel e ficar na surdina pelo resto dos nossos dias. "
"Isso parece tão ruim assim? ⟪k:3⟫Você é o único amigo que me resta, Jacopo”, ⟪k:4⟫disse ela, um "
"tanto desesperada.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Eu simpatizava com as preocupações dela, mas não queria deixar "
"escapar essa chance de ganhar algum poder real.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Eu estava farto de ter coisas "
"tiradas de mim."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EA17329F_E75A_43BA_ADE1_26A3F11A7C3C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46ab9ec2e84bfdcfc227123de9b12ee15eb593227195e82dba9a5441795bb63a
#. default-sha256: 6f3c5697c567d39c3ca1e7546bf4169cd721d2cce023bccbeae20e399a868f46
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EA17329F_E75A_43BA_ADE1_26A3F11A7C3C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I am the rightful heir!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu sou o herdeiro legítimo!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7000DBC8_446A_4CB0_AEAB_C85BBA32B424
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2dfb09ce1d3e90b30b9b11c6f76d5bb2bf049ea2dc46de19ed9675532b9fff5
#. default-sha256: 128d7b3b41d33110aa92c8c35cac1954d4e432a690a49271a690e1152b7bf5cc
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7000DBC8_446A_4CB0_AEAB_C85BBA32B424"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Victims of this terrible tyrant!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vítimas deste terrível tirano!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7127F800_978D_415A_8267_11EC7B9C8592
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f46740ae09beb62b9bebcc932a354ffc3e2128a8670a883ab6adc88685a201e2
#. default-sha256: 8859dc8a4db4ef1e9ef36fa2c151303e0173238b927ada4c1244b90282c2663e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7127F800_978D_415A_8267_11EC7B9C8592"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The time has come to start anew!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Chegou a hora de recomeçar!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_40D851D5_8FD4_4474_8B95_059DFDDEDC73
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 770ef1aff4a7ec63732e21672bd32ef6fe157a3395d8b9a0554db0ea2fee4d7e
#. default-sha256: ff09e557e16c88dd05b8ee8beca0918cb4730720e8444e759043f2a175724c92
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_40D851D5_8FD4_4474_8B95_059DFDDEDC73"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And I shall be the one to lead you down that path!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E eu serei aquele que lhes guiará por esse caminho!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B9D2A7DA_E011_4BB7_8DCA_8858D30581D3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: afafa3bb1c2e7f3d4338538b468f8936841fd8d718b032199e6e18c3b4375dc4
#. default-sha256: 3966dc7ae803d8e23c85599d4f81e9c3aaec7f8c01dbeb86a3778f372117364c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B9D2A7DA_E011_4BB7_8DCA_8858D30581D3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The poor! The hungry! The deprived!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Os pobres! Os famintos! Os desamparados!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_AE6EC68C_3EA4_47ED_9A66_E45793195EB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff4817a14da4379b45bf126c3e0cdac4c188dbc29ba8c245c71c9f0e64aff48f
#. default-sha256: 7ef8b63cb0ff7165608e7fc2cbc8e6c2eb5e9faf9882bb47c3a45ece40321302
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_AE6EC68C_3EA4_47ED_9A66_E45793195EB0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The lord, backed into a corner, begged for his life.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I decapitated "
"him, then held his severed head up for the people. ⟪k:6⟫Their cheers and shouts filled the air."
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫As I watched them rejoice, I wondered—⟪k:10⟫was this the future that awaited me?"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Would the people come after me next?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Was my head going to be "
"in one of their hands one day?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫O lorde, encurralado num canto, implorou por sua vida.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Eu o "
"decapitei e então levantei sua cabeça decepada para o povo. ⟪k:6⟫Seus aplausos e gritos encheram "
"o ar.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Enquanto os observava se regozijando, eu me perguntava—⟪k:10⟫era esse o "
"futuro que me esperava?⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫As pessoas viriam atrás de mim em seguida?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫Será que um dia minha cabeça estaria nas mãos de um deles?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_18150020_3EEE_43FC_AA71_F5B2DE30BC42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 747919280c0c58af11776dbc5a3f5616a44d9f6a9bb42f8e939b9a6713c90db9
#. default-sha256: 995779bb5cbf337fda4c0221b9006cda1895ad874c483f96a4ee4b6df0a83583
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_18150020_3EEE_43FC_AA71_F5B2DE30BC42"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I turned my attention first to bolstering the economy. ⟪k:1⟫I provided subsidies to "
"merchants in the city. I expanded trade routes. I made it known that people of any skin color, "
"even those not welcome in other territories, were welcome in my land, trying to bring some "
"vitality to the city.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The previous lord had evidently loved to throw parties, "
"squandering away nearly all the tax money on his own entertainment. ⟪k:5⟫If he had left me more "
"to work with, I would have used it to clean up and repair the slums, ⟪k:6⟫but for the time being, "
"that had to remain another item on the checklist.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I needed more money flowing "
"through the city as a whole before I could make any headway on fixing up the poorer areas. ⟪k:10⟫"
"Helping the people who needed it most quickly became a secondary objective."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Voltei minha atenção primeiro para o fortalecimento da economia. ⟪k:1⟫Forneci subsídios aos "
"comerciantes da cidade. Expandi as rotas comerciais. Divulguei que pessoas de qualquer cor de "
"pele, mesmo aquelas que não eram bem-vindas em outros territórios, eram bem-vindas em minhas "
"terras, tentando trazer alguma vitalidade à cidade.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫O lorde anterior evidentemente "
"adorava dar festas, esbanjando quase todo o dinheiro dos impostos em seu próprio entretenimento. "
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Se ele tivesse me deixado mais com que trabalhar, eu teria usado para limpar e "
"consertar as favelas, ⟪k:7⟫mas, por enquanto, isso tinha que permanecer como outro item na lista "
"de afazeres.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Eu precisava de mais dinheiro circulando pela cidade como um todo "
"antes de poder fazer qualquer progresso na recuperação das áreas mais pobres. ⟪k:11⟫Ajudar as "
"pessoas que mais precisavam rapidamente se tornou um objetivo secundário."

#: scenario8:scenario8_FCCA8475_D1C1_4BA6_8EBA_8D0A45786A6B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f40cae8e7a5891b71300227bb4445afa8bbb10c6f41f805a6f531adae3165e1
#. default-sha256: f3a9b8950440dd9516e8a85c3e3fd159074d250bbecf68a4d2f0a506aa660c48
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FCCA8475_D1C1_4BA6_8EBA_8D0A45786A6B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had a pretty good idea what my former accomplices still in the slums were saying about me. "
"⟪k:1⟫“He used us,” I could practically hear them whispering.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Some of them even "
"started publicly slandering me in an attempt to undermine my authority, ⟪k:5⟫claiming I wasn’t "
"suited to be in a position of power because I had spent most of my life in the slums. ⟪k:6⟫It "
"wasn’t long before they had convinced the people I was just another tyrant.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I "
"had hoped that they—if no one else—would have sympathized with my position. ⟪k:11⟫Realized that I "
"had every intention of helping them, ⟪k:12⟫and that I simply didn’t have the resources for it yet."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu tinha uma boa ideia do que meus antigos cúmplices ainda nas favelas estavam dizendo sobre "
"mim. ⟪k:1⟫“Ele nos usou”, praticamente podia ouvi-los sussurrando.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Alguns deles até "
"começaram a me caluniar publicamente, numa tentativa de minar minha autoridade, ⟪k:5⟫alegando que "
"eu não era adequado para estar em uma posição de poder porque passei a maior parte da minha vida "
"nas favelas. ⟪k:6⟫Não demorou muito para que eles convencessem as pessoas de que eu era apenas "
"mais um tirano.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Eu esperava que eles—se ninguém mais—teriam simpatizado com a "
"minha posição. ⟪k:11⟫Percebido que tinha toda a intenção de ajudá-los, ⟪k:12⟫e que simplesmente "
"não tinha ainda os recursos para isso."

#: scenario8:scenario8_74F4DAF7_A6A5_4130_AA52_804AC3EC79D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aab1a4ba779df8f552e553e8debb643a54141720ceafb8218d4887fb2fe951be
#. default-sha256: a8286fdf4b52ced58d8c965ad8eccef1c696ef60b82144f765291bb20af2217c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_74F4DAF7_A6A5_4130_AA52_804AC3EC79D0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having absolutely no one I could trust, no one I could call an ally, hit me a lot harder "
"than I had expected. It twisted my worldview beyond recognition.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I had no need for "
"sympathy.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I couldn’t show care for anyone, otherwise someone would inevitably use "
"it against me—old friends and strangers alike.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫In fact, those who knew me best—"
"⟪k:10⟫those who were aware of where I had come from and what I had been before—⟪k:11⟫were the "
"ones who fought the hardest to tear me down."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não ter absolutamente ninguém em quem confiar, ninguém a quem chamar de aliado, me atingiu "
"com muito mais força do que eu esperava. Distorceu minha visão de mundo a ponto de torná-la "
"irreconhecível.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Eu não precisava de simpatia.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Eu não poderia "
"demonstrar carinho por ninguém, caso contrário, alguém inevitavelmente usaria isso contra mim—"
"tanto velhos amigos quanto estranhos.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Na verdade, aqueles que me conheciam melhor—"
"⟪k:10⟫aqueles que sabiam de onde eu tinha vindo e o que eu tinha sido antes—⟪k:11⟫foram aqueles "
"que mais lutaram para me derrubar."

#: scenario8:scenario8_61EF1623_3BA9_4D6A_B73A_F6A05741CC9A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fafc4515225a31f0c6bfe243113e529700422eb08bc276a021011a35389d38a3
#. default-sha256: fc93b27dda4d24cd02d65bb573ed64a2a8afafb428f812d9e723964ff892ed50
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_61EF1623_3BA9_4D6A_B73A_F6A05741CC9A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Rules needed to be created.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Punishments established.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I couldn’t "
"allow anyone to take this power from me.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Anyone who so much as suggested I had come "
"from the slums—⟪k:10⟫anyone who dared disrespect me—⟪k:11⟫had to be eliminated.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"All threats exterminated before they could reach me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Regras precisavam ser criadas.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Punições estabelecidas.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Eu não "
"poderia permitir que ninguém tirasse esse poder de mim.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Qualquer um que ao menos "
"sugerisse que eu vim das favelas—⟪k:10⟫ qualquer um que ousasse me desrespeitar—⟪k:11⟫tinha que "
"ser eliminado.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Todas as ameaças exterminadas antes que pudessem me alcançar."

#: scenario8:scenario8_C76141A6_CD72_4910_BCFE_ACEB11E43F60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f445ab604dabbef57cbd246a8ea0b6c218cafdb18e88af60fa97d551a35b5d16
#. default-sha256: c5780b3636995b05633a21283ba61238a4407810961ca354cb31e7139932253a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C76141A6_CD72_4910_BCFE_ACEB11E43F60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Four years passed...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫and I found myself in a very, very distant place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quatro anos se passaram...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫e eu me encontrei em um lugar muito, muito distante."

#: scenario8:scenario8_22456B4C_6629_4799_B45D_335895B81169
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef9a3db0c074174f6b7b335baffd0ac241743e0bc514168a2a49816a9852ce34
#. default-sha256: 8fd17902476b554364a2cedbae269c4e0dfcde608315c5b3106cde439847b5e8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_22456B4C_6629_4799_B45D_335895B81169"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One day, a curious rumor came to my attention—⟪k:1⟫the kind of whispering I wouldn’t usually "
"put much stock into.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It was said that there was a witch living in a cottage by the "
"lake. ⟪k:5⟫Few had ever seen her face, but they claimed she had the same voice as a girl who had "
"supposedly performed miracles several years earlier in a faraway village."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Um dia, um rumor curioso chegou ao meu conhecimento—⟪k:1⟫o tipo de boato ao qual eu "
"normalmente não daria muita importância.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Diziam que havia uma bruxa que vivia numa "
"casa perto do lago. ⟪k:5⟫Poucos tinham visto o seu rosto, mas afirmavam que ela tinha a mesma voz "
"de uma menina que supostamente tinha realizado milagres vários anos antes numa aldeia distante."

#: scenario8:scenario8_1F61E9E8_448E_41B4_A3CA_43584C803A9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 872342a452a33eccdbf2dbec6d67826295735e756f0a3112bc6df7b98a9b5f11
#. default-sha256: 86f5d6fc8ffa6d31d3d44dc6449dcc5f09393995f58b50add93c0d8cd217f632
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1F61E9E8_448E_41B4_A3CA_43584C803A9F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had been expecting the man to object, but he agreed almost without hesitation.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫There was a mansion on the outskirts of the city, which the previous lord had built for "
"himself and had gone unused since his death. ⟪k:5⟫It was there I decided to keep the witch, and "
"it was there I decided to establish the church. ⟪k:6⟫The nun would have ample space there to "
"provide temporary shelter to the sick and needy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu estava esperando que o homem fosse se opor, mas ele aceitou quase sem hesitar.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Havia uma mansão nos arredores da cidade, que o lorde anterior havia construído para si "
"mesmo e que não era usada desde sua morte. ⟪k:5⟫Foi lá que decidi manter a bruxa e foi lá que "
"decidi estabelecer a igreja. ⟪k:6⟫A freira teria amplo espaço para fornecer abrigo temporário aos "
"doentes e necessitados."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F670D532_1354_4437_B03F_38E1D3CF6F47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2cb4cd7f13b5eb1d5bfe4656094cb51a5bfcc6be92acbf530653af34d7522c6
#. default-sha256: 01b26c70195ff5a2c10d9c4c88be4c9e973a7f4dbe4e0ac4f6e24b5fb5003570
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F670D532_1354_4437_B03F_38E1D3CF6F47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s our responsibility to offer a helping hand⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫to the sick and the poor,"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫to pray for the abandoned souls.⟪k:7⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫É nossa responsabilidade oferecer ajuda⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫aos doentes e aos pobres,⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫rezar pelas almas abandonadas.⟪k:7⟫"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A4DB698C_F9FC_4FFE_A03A_DDCCFDA6A76E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d58c68f5a3c553fc2a3931180f985830e39a693b07043e400cbf325b25506768
#. default-sha256: 4be39694d1556a0712403669955aef2c3c957f1d2206279caa51642bc9e0d06e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A4DB698C_F9FC_4FFE_A03A_DDCCFDA6A76E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Morgana’s words from years back popped into my head.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I believed that—as "
"aggressive, self-centered, and utterly lacking in compassion as my methods may have been—⟪k:4⟫I "
"was following that mantra. ⟪k:5⟫I was offering a helping hand to people who needed it in the only "
"way I knew how.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I wasn’t so dense as to think she would approve of me making an old "
"woman pay the price for my “charity,” though. ⟪k:9⟫Doing this made me no better than a thug.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫But everything has a price. ⟪k:13⟫For every extravagant feast held, a dozen people go "
"the night without food. ⟪k:14⟫That’s simply the way of the world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫As palavras de Morgana de anos atrás surgiram na minha cabeça.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Eu acreditei que"
"—por mais agressivos, egocêntricos e totalmente desprovidos de compaixão quanto meus métodos "
"pudessem ter sido—⟪k:4⟫eu estava seguindo esse mantra. ⟪k:5⟫Estava oferecendo ajuda às pessoas "
"que precisavam da única maneira que eu sabia.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Não era tão estúpido a ponto de "
"pensar que ela aprovaria que eu fizesse uma velha pagar o preço pela minha \"caridade\", no "
"entanto. ⟪k:9⟫Fazer isso não me tornava melhor do que um bandido.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Mas tudo tem "
"um preço. ⟪k:13⟫Para cada banquete extravagante realizado, uma dúzia de pessoas passa a noite sem "
"comer. ⟪k:14⟫É simplesmente assim que o mundo funciona."

#: scenario8:scenario8_61554D03_893A_41EE_8BBA_179B84C6C896
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb61cf5c3d67a12d215db971585fedbfbebfd6953416ae3a9daf87fbc5269fe2
#. default-sha256: 909ca7aa30d7289c308a8e1f31dec43f7750b6097d9cbfc6c6e3b81ea7f41c7b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_61554D03_893A_41EE_8BBA_179B84C6C896"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Several days later than originally planned, the swordsman finally arrived at the "
"mansion. ⟪k:3⟫I had chosen the observation tower on the grounds for the witch’s prison, and it "
"was there I waited for him.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫He showed up with a burlap sack swung over his "
"shoulder, setting it down on the ground and saying, “There’s your witch.” ⟪k:7⟫I could only hear "
"muffled grunting from inside the sack, ⟪k:8⟫but it didn’t sound like an old woman inside.⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The man’s clothes and the bag both reeked of blood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ Vários dias depois do planejado originalmente, o espadachim finalmente chegou à "
"mansão. ⟪k:3⟫Eu havia escolhido a torre de observação do terreno para a prisão da bruxa, e foi lá "
"que o esperei.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Ele apareceu com um saco de estopa pendurado no ombro, colocando-o "
"no chão e dizendo: \"Aí está sua bruxa\". ⟪k:7⟫Eu só conseguia ouvir grunhidos abafados de dentro "
"do saco, ⟪k:8⟫mas não parecia uma velha lá dentro.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫As roupas do homem e o saco "
"fediam a sangue."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D174ED03_34BC_4FC3_A79B_A75477B61643
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 270cb35c452dc76bcc724d2bb4d1cee2c065b0e75a61aecf27fc70de69282059
#. default-sha256: cddb97cd9c84b6fe92fb42913c9ec91a9ae423be0b8e968f7032cb292a4844b1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D174ED03_34BC_4FC3_A79B_A75477B61643"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I felt a tinge of guilt for the woman, but it didn’t last long. ⟪k:1⟫Her role in my scheme, "
"and the fate that awaited her, was the same regardless of the condition she arrived in.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫I tossed my gaze from the man to the bag. ⟪k:5⟫He crouched down to untie it—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫revealing⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫a young girl⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫with one "
"arm severed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Senti uma ponta de culpa pela mulher, mas não durou muito. ⟪k:1⟫O seu papel no meu plano e o "
"destino que a esperava eram os mesmos, independentemente da condição em que chegasse.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫Eu joguei meu olhar do homem para o saco. ⟪k:5⟫Ele se agachou para desamarrá-lo—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫revelando⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫uma jovem⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫com um "
"braço decepado."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EA6D90FB_E469_416A_A738_8A2F87752A30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfc022bedf68c34dedd22270652c74c76e631242c7891ab8c97418122ac21594
#. default-sha256: 4ec1359e464fd2c11ccbd80350fcec2729fa2b59963eae50351b309a0aabccb7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EA6D90FB_E469_416A_A738_8A2F87752A30"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Morgana...”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Morgana...”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_04F98E44_30C7_4035_A186_6C4D936E75E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87ff28528d6d99f4baf09400cbf6707667b368665dc61a4857c6e6425d2fbc6b
#. default-sha256: 8cb42e488210324c0e91b3c64efabb910cc910c4bff11cf745740ecdb5285087
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_04F98E44_30C7_4035_A186_6C4D936E75E8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My voice was hoarse and rattling.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫She looked up at me, her face just as "
"disfigured and hideous as it had been four years before.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫My mind flashed back to "
"her birthday, ⟪k:7⟫to when I had considered offering to take her as my lifetime partner if her "
"face hadn’t healed in four years’ time.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Is that you...?”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫Her question yanked me out of my memories."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Minha voz estava rouca e trêmula.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ela olhou para mim, seu rosto tão "
"desfigurado e horrível quanto estava quatro anos antes.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Minha mente voltou ao "
"aniversário dela, ⟪k:7⟫quando eu havia considerado me oferecer para ter ela como minha "
"companheira para a vida toda se seu rosto não tivesse sarado em quatro anos.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫“É você...?”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫A pergunta dela me arrancou das minhas memórias."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D4A32F3B_556D_40F8_8639_D047D18336A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1e0db24f1dff679bae89490b3d20cdacda899ff8fc926a80ae6d77696838708
#. default-sha256: e4cc921de7916e7259fb0714f29e3515e2d77430f57ca47b1e755faf0e8db18d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D4A32F3B_556D_40F8_8639_D047D18336A3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Haven’t had enough, have you? ⟪k:1⟫Leaving scars on every inch of my body wasn’t enough for "
"you?! ⟪k:2⟫You haven’t had your fill of my blood?!”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫No... that wasn’t me..."
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I—⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫I was the one who had tried to heal those wounds..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Não foi o suficiente, não é? ⟪k:1⟫Deixar cicatrizes em cada centímetro do meu corpo não foi "
"o suficiente para você?! ⟪k:2⟫Já não teve o suficiente do meu sangue?!”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Não... "
"esse não era eu...⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Eu—⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Eu fui quem tentou curar aquelas feridas..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BC62DAA1_B501_4055_A094_5C4911619331
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f495d61ae8b90ace2ea93a7a8da11474c99ddb476e065c311e8e178af4f5d64
#. default-sha256: 78aed19706de57844466207c29f85349143e1e91eb1d122ea548795d747c0cb1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BC62DAA1_B501_4055_A094_5C4911619331"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“You’re the man who bound me... cut me up... called me a witch... and then tried to kill me! "
"⟪k:1⟫I haven’t forgotten you even for a moment!”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫No, Morgana...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"I was the man who rescued you from him..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Você é o homem que me amarrou... me cortou... me chamou de bruxa... e depois tentou me "
